reason: Projection does not contain column v required by the query, so it could only filter the base table\'s parts, which EXPLAIN WHATIF does not estimate yet
With p_skipidx (normal projection, hypothetical):
reason: EXPLAIN WHATIF does not estimate projections with their own skip indexes yet
